  "description": "Brand new 3 Bed House, 5 minute walk from Woodbrook DART, Shankill\n\n€3,500 per month | Available from 5 October | Approx 100sqm\n\nA newly built, never lived in, three bedroom end of terrace house, with large balcony and back garden, at Woodbrook in Shankill, under a five minute walk from Woodbrook DART station. \n\nWoodbrook station is at the end of the road, around 40 minutes from the city centre, with up to 191 DART services every weekday. Bray is one stop south and Dún Laoghaire a short run north. For anyone driving, the N11 is minutes away. Parking space included.\n\nFurnished or unfurnished. The photographs show the house unfurnished as the flooring has only just been laid. New furniture is ready to install this week if you would prefer it furnished, at no extra cost.\n\nThe living accommodation is upstairs to make the most of the light. The open plan living, dining and kitchen area opens onto a private 10sqm balcony, with a separate utility store housing the washing machine.\n\nAll three bedrooms are on the ground floor along with a guest WC. The main bedroom with ensuite, the second takes a double, and the third is a comfortable single. Private garden to the rear.\n\nBER A0. The highest rating available, meeting Zero Emission Building criteria. Assessed energy use is 2,467 kWh a year with 43 per cent generated on site. Heating and hot water run off an air to water heat pump, so there is no gas or oil bill and running costs are a fraction of an older house.\n\nTo arrange a viewing, please send a message through Daft including the number of people who would be living in the house, your preferred move in date, whether you would like it furnished or unfurnished, and whether you are able to provide a previous landlord reference.\n\nBER: A0  | Valid to 11 August 2036",
